Lets I3 (invariants.rs `i3_no_resurrection`) count the records their author's
revert discarded again, on both sides, as before the I3 half of 15d13ea, so a
pending tombstone the revert threw away unannounced is taken for a deletion
the mesh agreed on. The fix leaves such records out because nobody else ever
held them (DESIGN.md §14.1 I3, §8.3).

test: delocal-sim regressions::a_tombstone_a_revert_discarded_is_not_a_deletion

